      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "LORA DATASET PREP\n\n1. Set source_folder and a separate output_folder.\n2. Choose training_focus for the LoRA target: person, object, background, outfit, item, pose, art_style, visual_effect, expression, camera_angle, composition, logo, symbol, or auto. Use custom_focus to add instructions; custom requires it.\n3. Set trigger_word, or leave it empty to omit a prefix.\n4. Select an installed upscaler model, or disconnect it and use lanczos.\n5. Queue, then inspect PNG/TXT pairs and review_index.html before training.\n\nSet skip_existing=false to regenerate existing pairs after changing the focus or other caption settings. Qwen3-VL downloads on the first run."
      ],
